# 🎲 Phase 3 — Maze generation (CORE) ✅

Algorithm: **Iterative DFS with backtracking**

1. Start from entry cell, mark visited
2. Stamp "42" pattern (visited=True, all walls kept)
3. Push to stack
4. Pick random unvisited neighbor
5. Remove wall between current and neighbor
6. Mark neighbor visited, push to stack
7. If no neighbors → pop (backtrack)
8. Repeat until stack is empty

All cells visited ✅ — Walls consistent ✅ — "42" cells never carved ✅

