# 🧾 Phase 5 — Output file ✅

* Each cell → binary → hex digit (1 char)
* Bit 0=N, Bit 1=E, Bit 2=S, Bit 3=W
* Written row by row
* Entry and exit appended after empty line
* PATH line still TODO (needs BFS)

